1
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
It was a dangerous time to be a woman. And a good time to have friends.

2
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Bad Girls is a romance, western film directed by Jonathan Kaplan.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Four former harlots try to leave the wild west (Colorado, to be exact)
and head north to make a better life for themselves.

4
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Unfortunately someone from Cody's past won't let it happen that easily.

5
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Cody Zamora, played by Madeleine Stowe.

6
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Anita Crown, played by Mary Stuart Masterson.

7
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Eileen Spenser, played by Andie MacDowell.

8
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Lily Laronette, played by Drew Barrymore.

9
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:36,000
Kid Jarrett, played by James Russo.

10
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
William Tucker, played by James LeGros.

11
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Bad Girls is a 1994 American Western film directed by Jonathan
Kaplan, and written by Ken Friedman and Yolande Turner.

12
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
It stars Madeleine Stowe, Mary Stuart Masterson,
Andie MacDowell, and Drew Barrymore.

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
The film follows four former prostitutes on the run following a justifiable homicide and prison
escape, who later encounter difficulties involving bank robbery and Pinkerton detectives.

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
The film was originally conceived as a feminist Western and a low-budget independent film,
until producers Albert Ruddy and André Morgan brought in 20th Century Fox.

15
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The involvement of a major studio substantially increased the film's
budget and necessitated the casting of big-name actresses.

16
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Principal photography began in July 1993 in Sonora, California with director Tamra Davis at the helm, but shortly
into filming, producers fired Davis and reconceptualized the movie to be more of an action film.

17
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
Jonathan Kaplan was hired to replace Davis.

18
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
Bad Girls opened in North American theaters on April 22, 1994.

19
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
It received largely negative reviews and was a box office disappointment, with critics opining
that the film squandered its encouraging premise and misused its four female leads.

20
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of blonde, revenge, tough girl, wild west, fast draw.

21
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
The tone is emotional.
